*
!.gitignore
!*.md

# Mutation-testing artifacts are REVIEW MATERIAL, not scratch (Codex round 11P's
# [medium] #4). A mutation matrix is evidence about the tests, and the reviewer being
# asked to trust it has to be able to read the applier that produced it and re-run the
# spec. So a `<wave>-mutations/` directory tracks its applier and its spec; its
# transcripts are markdown and `!*.md` above already covers them.
#
# Everything else here stays ignored, which is the point of the `*` at the top: the
# ~1.9MB of `review-*.diff` exports are derived from git history and belong nowhere
# near it.
!*-mutations/
!*-mutations/*.py
!*-mutations/*.json
